      "writtenOn": "2022-11-10T22:50:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This config file was copied from \u0027frameworks/av/media/libeffects/data/audio_effects.xml\u0027. I think we actually don\u0027t need the offload information from config file anymore, instead each effect implementation need to report their capability (including offload/sw) in descriptor, and framework side use IEffect.getDescriptor() to check this capability.\n\nUse libsw/libhw to indicate different implementation is not scalable (for example the case of more than two sw based implementation for same effect), but for backward compatibility it can still exist in audio_effects_config.xml, but EffectConfig parser will ignore them.",
      "parentUuid": "e106b7a1_24b79d34",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 39,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 41,
        "endChar": 80
